"Message frequency varies. After explicit consent, XTimers may attempt to\n      send one setup verification message when a user requests verification of\n      the proposed account phone number. XTimers may attempt reminder SMS only\n      after successful verification and opt-in, and only when the account owner\n      creates and schedules that SMS reminder for themselves. Users cannot send chat replies\n      or user-authored messages to XTimers by SMS." = "Učestalost poruka varira. Nakon izričitog pristanka, XTimers može pokušati poslati jednu poruku za potvrdu postavki kad korisnik zatraži potvrdu predloženog broja telefona računa. XTimers može pokušati podsjetnik SMS samo nakon uspješne provjere i pristanka, i samo kada vlasnik računa kreira i zakazuje taj SMS podsjetnik za sebe. Korisnici ne mogu slati chat odgovore ili poruke koje pišu korisnici XTimers putem SMS.";
