"Reply STOP to opt out of SMS messages from XTimers. After you send STOP,\n      XTimers will stop sending SMS messages to that phone number\n      unless you opt in again." = "Odgovorite STOP kako biste se odjavili s SMS poruka od XTimers. Nakon što pošaljete STOP, XTimers će prestati slati SMS poruke na taj telefonski broj osim ako se ponovno ne prijavite.";
